=2 Walkthrough
* Zone after finishing the previous quest.
* Return to {n:Magriffon} (I-7) who will give you {k:Treasure map} ({p:Key Item}) after you trade him more gil.
* Go to the three places in {z:Yuhtunga Jungle} on the {k:Treasure map}: (F-7) (H-10) and (I-12).
* At each spot on the map you will find a **Blue Rafflesia**.
** Examining each **Blue Rafflesia** will give you a {i:Rafflesia Nectar|Rafflesia Nectar|1144}.
* Return to {n:Magriffon} to finish the quest.

=4 Notes:
* You must zone after completing {q:Gullible's Travels|Gullible's Travels|Gullible's Travels} before you can flag this quest.
* After completing this quest, all {p:Mithra} in {z:Kazham} will be repulsed by you, but Opo-opos will be attracted to you.
** The only way to fix this is by completing {q:Personal Hygiene|Personal Hygiene|Personal Hygiene}, however it is recommended that you finish {q:The Opo-opo and I|The Opo-opo and I|The Opo-opo and I} quest first so you can get an {i:Opo-opo Crown|Opo-opo Crown|13870}.

